@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Cookie Policy";
}

<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>
<p><strong>Last updated:</strong> September 2026</p>

<p>
    DohFlo is a portfolio demonstration. The site is intended to use only the
    cookies and similar browser storage needed to operate and secure the
    application.
</p>

<h2 class="h4 mt-4">Essential cookies</h2>
<p>
    Essential cookies may be used to maintain a secure sign-in session, protect
    form submissions, remember temporary application state, and support other
    core security functions. Blocking these cookies may prevent sign-in or other
    application features from working correctly.
</p>

<h2 class="h4 mt-4">Analytics and advertising</h2>
<p>
    DohFlo does not currently intend to use advertising cookies or sell browsing
    information. If analytics or another third-party service is added later,
    this policy will be updated before that service is enabled for public users.
</p>

<h2 class="h4 mt-4">Managing cookies</h2>
<p>
    Most browsers allow visitors to view, block, or delete cookies through the
    browser settings. Removing essential cookies may sign the visitor out or
    interrupt the current session.
</p>
